  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_01",
      "hash64": "8981630884E660E8",
      "text": "Guardad los móviles, niños, que empieza la\\nclase.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_02",
      "hash64": "8981660884E66601",
      "text": "El otro día hablamos de los efectos que aporta\\nla comida de los pícnics.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_03",
      "hash64": "8981650884E6644E",
      "text": "Además de permitiros obtener Nutripoderes,\\nes realmente útil como método curativo y puede\\r\\nrestaurar la salud de todo vuestro equipo.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_04",
      "hash64": "8981680884E66967",
      "text": "Sin embargo, no resulta factible en situaciones\\nde emergencia o en las que no se pueda cocinar,\\r\\ncomo en mitad de un combate, evidentemente.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_05",
      "hash64": "8981670884E667B4",
      "text": "En esos casos, lo mejor es echar mano de objetos\\ncurativos como las [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]pociones[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], que se venden en\\r\\nlas Tiendas Pokémon o la tienda de la academia.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_06",
      "hash64": "89816A0884E66CCD",
      "text": "Las medicinas tienen un efecto instantáneo y\\npara emplearlas solo hay que abrir la Bolsa.\\c\\nPor otra parte, como ya sabréis, son de un solo\\nuso.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_07",
      "hash64": "8981690884E66B1A",
      "text": "Una Poción restaura 20 PS; una Superpoción,\\n60 PS, y una Hiperpoción, 120 PS.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_08",
      "hash64": "89815C0884E65503",
      "text": "Cuanto más cara, más eficaz es la medicina.\\c\\nLa regla de oro es hacer acopio en función del\\npresupuesto del que uno disponga.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_09",
      "hash64": "89815B0884E65350",
      "text": "Pero, cuando se parte de viaje, pueden suceder,\\ny de hecho suceden, improvistos de toda índole.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_10",
      "hash64": "897DDE0884E34912",
      "text": "Os pondré un ejemplo: imaginad que vuestro\\nequipo está herido y no tenéis pociones a mano.\\c\\nTampoco disponéis de ingredientes para elaborar\\nun bocadillo y, para colmo de males, no hay un\\r\\nsolo Centro Pokémon cerca de donde estáis.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 188,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 234,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_11",
      "hash64": "897DDF0884E34AC5",
      "text": "¿Sabríais decirme qué deberíais buscar por los\\nalrededores en tan precaria situación?\\c\\n¿Qué opinas tú, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_g_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "EF241B8087EC8499",
      "text": "Un pozo",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_g_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "EF24188087EC7F80",
      "text": "Un profesor",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_g_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "EF24198087EC8133",
      "text": "Un objeto en el suelo",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_answer_01",
      "hash64": "824B9E2A383E0FD1",
      "text": "Os recuerdo que no disponéis de ingredientes.\\c\\nY sin ellos no es posible preparar nada aunque\\ndispongáis de agua.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_answer_02",
      "hash64": "824B9B2A383E0AB8",
      "text": "Ciertamente, si hubiera un profesor, podría\\nprestaros ayuda.\\c\\nPero no debéis dar por sentado que siempre\\nhabrá un adulto cerca para sacaros de un apuro.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_answer_03",
      "hash64": "824B9C2A383E0C6B",
      "text": "¡Correcto! Muy bien.\\c\\nVeo que entiendes de técnicas de supervivencia,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_12",
      "hash64": "897DDC0884E345AC",
      "text": "Lo que os conviene hacer es prestar atención\\na vuestro alrededor y, si veis un destello en el\\r\\nsuelo, acercaros a examinarlo.\\c\\nTal vez la suerte os sonría con una Baya Aranja,\\nuna poción o algún otro objeto curativo.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 220,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_13",
      "hash64": "897DDD0884E3475F",
      "text": "Podéis recogerlo vosotros mismos, o también\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]pulsar el botón R para enviar un Pokémon[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_14",
      "hash64": "897DDA0884E34246",
      "text": "A diferencia de los artículos de las tiendas, las\\nbayas se pueden dar a los Pokémon para que\\r\\nlas usen ellos mismos cuando las necesiten en\\r\\ncombate.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_15",
      "hash64": "897DDB0884E343F9",
      "text": "Puede resultar muy interesante observar cómo y\\ncuándo las usan.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_16",
      "hash64": "897DD80884E33EE0",
      "text": "Resumiendo: cuando os veáis en apuros para\\ncurar a vuestros Pokémon, buscad un destello\\r\\nen el suelo. Ese es mi consejo de hoy.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_17",
      "hash64": "897DD90884E34093",
      "text": "A falta de bayas, hay otras formas de recuperar\\nPS, como...\\c\\nOh, pero el timbre no perdona. Tendremos que\\ndejar el asunto para otra ocasión.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_18",
      "hash64": "897DE60884E356AA",
      "text": "La clase ha terminado por hoy.\\n¡Adiós, niños![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
